[en.SP_NUCLEAR_OVERCHARGE]
Magictron Overcharge Technology

[en.SP_NUCLEAR_OVERCHARGE_desc]
Those who often host parties know that it is easy to deflate a balloon but hard to inflate one. When you muster up the courage to blow a balloon to its full capacity, you might be startled by the sound of the balloon popping. Magictron Overcharge Technology operates on the same principle, except that it is not air that is blown in but magictrons, and it is not balloons that are filled but magical artifacts.
A frequently misunderstood question is: “Isn’t the explosion you get proportional to the amount of air you blow in?” In fact, these “artifacts” are called artifacts because they have a huge capacity for magictrons, and even after being used for thousands of years, they are still full —— not to mention artifacts like the Grogar’s Bell that are constantly being charged by the user. Therefore, we only need to inject a teeny bit of magictrons into these artifacts that are already close to their limits, to release all of their stored energy, generating a cataclysmic force in an instant. Of course, we must also remind you that the fact that these artifacts have been used for thousands of years without any accidents is enough to show, that the vital capacity required to burst a “balloon” is quite substantial.

[zh.SP_NUCLEAR_OVERCHARGE]
魔法子过充能技术

[zh.SP_NUCLEAR_OVERCHARGE_desc]
经常举办派对的朋友都知道，放气容易，充气难，当你鼓足勇气把气球吹得满满的时候，一不小心你就会被气球的爆炸声吓一跳。魔法子过充能技术采用相同的原理，只不过吹入的不是空气而是魔法子，填满的不是气球而是法器。
一个时常被误解的问题在于：“难道不是你充多少气，才能有多大的爆炸么？” 事实上，这些“法器”之所以被称为法器，就是因为他们本身就有着巨大的魔法子容，并且即使被使用了几千年，依然满满当当 —— 更何况格罗迦之铃等会被使用者不断充能的法器呢？因此，我们只需要在这些本就已经接近极限的法器中再充入少量魔法子，就能将其中的库存全部释放，瞬间产生毁天灭地的力量。不过当然，我们也要提醒，这些法器被使用了上千年都没有发生意外，也足以说明想要撑爆一只“气球”所需要的肺活量。
